The {.} works as hyphenation between words, right? {la djak.kenedis.}... =
if it isn't that {djak} and {kenedis} are hyphenated with {.}, what is =
it? Are {jan.pol} and {levin.stros} for the hyphenated names "Jean-Paul" =
and "L=E9vi-Strauss" wrong, then?=20

